## Modules: vPager.sys
#
# VERTICAL PAGER

## Colorsets
## .fvwm/Extension/Colorsets.sys

## Vertical Pager (4 desks with 1 page each)

DesktopName 0 Web
DesktopName 1 Email
DesktopName 2 Office
DesktopName 3 Media

DesktopSize "1 1"  ## (columns - rows)

## 1. Desk Indicator Bar (90x28 total: 27px label + 1px white line)
DestroyModuleConfig VdeskBar: *
*VdeskBar: Geometry 90x28-0+11
*VdeskBar: Columns 1
*VdeskBar: Rows 28
*VdeskBar: Frame 0
*VdeskBar: Padding 0 0
*VdeskBar: Font "xft:Sans:size=11:antialias=True"
*VdeskBar: (1x27, Id "desk_ind", Title "Desk $[desk.n]", Colorset 36)
*VdeskBar: (1x1, Colorset 12)

## 2. Event Listener to Update Desk Number Immediately on Switch
DestroyFunc UpdateDeskBar
AddToFunc UpdateDeskBar
+ I SendToModule VdeskBar ChangeButton desk_ind Title "Desk $[desk.n]"

DestroyModuleConfig VdeskEvent: *
*VdeskEvent: Cmd Function
*VdeskEvent: new_desk UpdateDeskBar

## 3. Vertical Pager Directly Below (90x260 total, flush at Y=39)
DestroyModuleConfig VdeskPager: *
*VdeskPager: Geometry 90x260-0+39
*VdeskPager: Rows 4
*VdeskPager: Colorset * 36
*VdeskPager: HilightColorset * 35
*VdeskPager: BalloonColorset * 10
*VdeskPager: WindowColorsets 37 18
*VdeskPager: Font "xft:Sans:size=11:antialias=True"
*VdeskPager: WindowBorderWidth 1
*VdeskPager: BalloonStringFormat %c
*VdeskPager: BalloonYOffset +2
*VdeskPager: Window3dBorders
*VdeskPager: UseSkipList
*VdeskPager: MiniIcons

## Window Styles
Style VdeskBar NoTitle, !Handles, BorderWidth 0, Sticky, WindowListSkip, FixedSize, !Iconifiable, NeverFocus
Style VdeskPager NoTitle, !Handles, BorderWidth 0, Sticky, WindowListSkip, FixedSize, !Iconifiable, NeverFocus

## Launch Modules
Module FvwmButtons VdeskBar
Module FvwmEvent VdeskEvent
Module FvwmPager VdeskPager 0 3

## Change preloaded settings
# *ControlMP: Geometry 330x32-132+10
